T07:00:00Z","sellerName":"itslearning as","trackId":1640277495,"trackName":"itslearning","version":"1.13.0","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"You can access your learning courses with the itslearning mobile app.\n\nCreated with a focus on the daily needs of students and teachers, the official itslearning app brings the itslearning experience to the device of your choice. Now you can:\n- Have a clear and simple overview of what you need to do for your courses, divided into categories according to deadlines\n- Use the messaging function\n- Submit assignments*\n- Take surveys and tests*\n- Check your school calendar*\n- Check course announcements and updates\n- Access course resources*\n\nLogging in is easy: simply search for your school or site (district, municipality, institution…), and select your login method. Enter your username and password, and you're ready to go! No further steps are required. You need an existing itslearning account to use our app.\n\nYou can always start with the app: the app remembers your login.\n\n*When something is not natively built into the app, a browser window is opened and you can continue there with a full itslearning experience.\n\nThe app will ask for the following permissions:\n- Images and files (to add attachments to your messages)\n- Notifications (to receive push notifications)","trackCensoredName":"itslearning","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/itslearning/id1640277495?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","averageUserRating":1.16964,"bundleId":"com.itslearning.main","primaryGenreName":"Education","primaryGenreId":6017,"userRatingCount":112}